    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tough as nails rogue-like. Level up, pick skills, and modify your weapons. Control KOLOTUN. Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SURVIVE KOLOTUN</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cold war went hot. Republic R nuked The Freedom Alliance off the map before they could even respond. In full nuclear winter, the world knows this place and event now as KOLOTUN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FIGHT, SURVIVE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KOLOTUN grows colder. Militant groups, Crumbling Governments, Guerilla Factions, and others attempt to seize control.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the nuclear winter, take control of KOLOTUN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your weapons and skills to out match your assailant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>UPGRAGE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter you will learn from. Learn new skills to make defending yourself easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find attachments to make your weapons more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428240/extras/d4bec76e12aeb14603ae6e6c650410fd.avif?t=1741203314\" width=800 height=270 /></span></p>",
